---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import ContactEmail from "../components/ContactEmail.astro";
---
<LegalPage title="Contact" description="Report a broken font, suggest a workflow, or ask a question about ASCII Banner.">
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>For font attribution corrections, rendering bugs, privacy questions, or partnership inquiries, email <ContactEmail />.</p>
  <p>Please include the font name, the text that produced the issue, the target width, and the browser you used when reporting a rendering problem. Do not include secrets or private source code.</p>
  <h2>Font requests</h2>
  <p>The site follows the fonts distributed with figlet.js. New fonts must have clear redistribution terms and work reliably with printable ASCII input before they can be added.</p>
  <h2>Response expectations</h2>
  <p>This is a small independent tool. Messages are reviewed as time permits, and security or attribution issues receive priority.</p>
</LegalPage>
